Mori Gruvbox
============

This project is a derivative work. It reuses and modifies the color theme
"Gruvbox" for Visual Studio Code.

1. Gruvbox for Visual Studio Code
---------------------------------
upstream/gruvbox-dark-hard.json
themes/mori-gruvbox-dark-hard.json (derived)

    Copyright © 2017 JD
    Source:  https://github.com/jdinhify/vscode-theme-gruvbox
    License: MIT (full text in upstream/LICENSE.txt)

    All tokenColors, semanticTokenColors and the majority of theme colors are
    taken from the upstream theme without modification. Only UI colors
    (the "colors" object) are partially overridden by this project; the full
    list of overrides is in src/overrides.json. The upstream MIT license and
    copyright notice are retained as required.

2. "Gruvbox" color palette
--------------------------
The Gruvbox color palette was created by Pavel Pertsev (morhetz).

    Source: https://github.com/morhetz/gruvbox
    License: MIT

3. Mozg / mori-code integration
-------------------------------
mozg/mori-neutral.css contains CSS custom property overrides that restyle the
webview of the "Mozg" extension (publisher mori-ai, id mori-code). It is not
an official part of that extension and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
Mozg AI. The extension itself is not redistributed here: the script patches a
file in your local installation only, and can revert it.

